  "description": "Add-on package for Dew.Math that provides enhanced TeeChart features:\n • High-speed GridSeries with comprehensive color palette management.\n • MtxFastLine series for rendering millions of points efficiently.\n • Fast helpers for pushing data into TeeChart series.\n • Supports .NET Framework 4.8 and modern .NET (8/9) on Windows.\n • 64-bit native mode supported.\n • XML documentation for modern .NET targets.\n\nNote: Prior to Dew.Math 6.3.7 this assembly shipped inside the Dew.Math package.\nFrom 6.3.7 onward it is a separate, optional package to keep TeeChart integration opt-in.",
